<Base title="Work"><section class="interior"><div class="eyebrow">WORK / WHAT I DO</div><h1>Building. Connecting.<br/>Translating.</h1><p class="lede">I help turn ideas into things that work, bring the right people into the room, and make sense of the space between strategy and execution.</p><div class="detail-grid"><article><span class="index">01 / BUILDING</span><h2>From possibility to practice.</h2><p>Finding the opportunity inside an ambiguous challenge, then creating the systems, momentum, and clarity to move it forward.</p></article><article><span class="index">02 / CONNECTING</span><h2>Making good things happen together.</h2><p>Building relationships and environments where people, organizations, and ideas can find each other.</p></article><article><span class="index">03 / TRANSLATING</span><h2>Between worlds.</h2><p>Connecting strategy with the people and processes that turn it into something real.</p></article></div><div class="callout"><div class="eyebrow">WAYS TO WORK TOGETHER / WORKSHOP EXAMPLE</div><h2>Winning with Data</h2><p>A three-session workshop for cross-functional leadership teams: understand the current state, align on shared measures of success, and build a prioritized roadmap with clear ownership.</p><p>Designed as three 90-minute working sessions, not a presentation series.</p></div><div class="callout tools-callout"><div class="eyebrow">TOOLS & FRAMEWORKS</div><h2>Things I’ve made along the way.</h2><p>Assessments, decision tools, and working frameworks developed through years of experience as an employee and consultant. One example is a self-guided growth readiness assessment you can try right now.</p><p><a class="button" href="/assessment/">Try the growth readiness assessment →</a></p></div><div class="callout"><div class="eyebrow">CURRENTLY</div><p>Working with Innovate Carolina and The Junction at UNC–Chapel Hill, helping grow community, partnerships, and connections across the innovation ecosystem.</p></div></section></Base>
